invariant: INV-17
file: src/chacha20.c
catches: chacha20_wipe_test
reason: the wipe below chacha20_block and chacha20_xor covers 128 bytes,
  less than the frames of their bodies, so the deepest of those frames
  keep what the body left there. bin/chacha20_wipe_test measures how far
  below its caller each body writes and requires that inside the length.

--- old
#define CHACHA20_BELOW_LEN 512
--- new
#define CHACHA20_BELOW_LEN 128
